    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/063cc1fe7f020ebec9052cefee7644b9.poster.avif?t=1724981607\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/063cc1fe7f020ebec9052cefee7644b9.webm?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/063cc1fe7f020ebec9052cefee7644b9.mp4?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><i>Enter The Mansion</i></strong><br>You've been sent to a haunted mansion in the mountains with the goal of fixing a nearby lighthouse. Monsters that live inside the mansion will do everything they can to stop you, and keep the lights off. You'll have to fight them off while repairing the generator, and getting out alive. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/5af63a1b9b535f0e605afb837f911f34.poster.avif?t=1724981607\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/5af63a1b9b535f0e605afb837f911f34.webm?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/5af63a1b9b535f0e605afb837f911f34.mp4?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><i>Unique Monsters</i></strong><br>More monsters appear the deeper you go into the mansion, and they'll work together to catch you. All of the monsters have strengths and weaknesses you'll need to figure out to survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/2ef75b085a42a9260ec367e0ca2c6dd4.poster.avif?t=1724981607\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/2ef75b085a42a9260ec367e0ca2c6dd4.webm?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/2ef75b085a42a9260ec367e0ca2c6dd4.mp4?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><i>Features</i></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interact with fixable objects around the mansion using a point and click style interaction system.<br></li><li>Choose equipment to take with you before entering the mansion.<br></li><li>Survive against the monsters using only your Light Gun, and what you fix.<br></li><li>Do a good job, and get a higher grade on your report.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/063cc1fe7f020ebec9052cefee7644b9.poster.avif?t=1724981607\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/063cc1fe7f020ebec9052cefee7644b9.webm?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/063cc1fe7f020ebec9052cefee7644b9.mp4?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><i>Enter The Mansion</i></strong><br>You've been sent to a haunted mansion in the mountains with the goal of fixing a nearby lighthouse. Monsters that live inside the mansion will do everything they can to stop you, and keep the lights off. You'll have to fight them off while repairing the generator, and getting out alive. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/5af63a1b9b535f0e605afb837f911f34.poster.avif?t=1724981607\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/5af63a1b9b535f0e605afb837f911f34.webm?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/5af63a1b9b535f0e605afb837f911f34.mp4?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><i>Unique Monsters</i></strong><br>More monsters appear the deeper you go into the mansion, and they'll work together to catch you. All of the monsters have strengths and weaknesses you'll need to figure out to survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/2ef75b085a42a9260ec367e0ca2c6dd4.poster.avif?t=1724981607\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/2ef75b085a42a9260ec367e0ca2c6dd4.webm?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982680/extras/2ef75b085a42a9260ec367e0ca2c6dd4.mp4?t=1724981607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><i>Features</i></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interact with fixable objects around the mansion using a point and click style interaction system.<br></li><li>Choose equipment to take with you before entering the mansion.<br></li><li>Survive against the monsters using only your Light Gun, and what you fix.<br></li><li>Do a good job, and get a higher grade on your report.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Turn The Power Back On Inside a Haunted Mansion, while Fighting Off Paranormal Monsters.",
